      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-08T10:59:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the next patches, this will be called from HVC requests, it would be helpful to mention that this can be triggered by guests here.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 216,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 216,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "5e06f64ca5970b20148bdbb105b5ec36935af62b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "03bfeee0_47e1d979",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_pkvm_module.h",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 301,
      "author": {
        "id": 1965911
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-08T10:59:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We make the module pass the same cookie twice in reset and power_lock regeneration, which seems uncommon to me.\nI think we can some semantics to make only possible if reset_handler was already registered and then re-use the cookie passed there. wdyt?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 301,
        "startChar": 51,
        "endLine": 301,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "5e06f64ca5970b20148bdbb105b5ec36935af62b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "32239f07_bf25c3d1",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_pkvm_module.h",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 301,
      "author": {
        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-09T10:59:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s more or less what I do, but in both ways: the first one that sets the cookie \"wins\" unless this is NULL. \n\nThis way it can be called in any order and one can be used without the other. That just works in all situation. The only unsupported case is to use two different cookies.\n\nI believe this is just more robust and versatile.",
      "parentUuid": "03bfeee0_47e1d979",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 301,
        "startChar": 51,
        "endLine": 301,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "5e06f64ca5970b20148bdbb105b5ec36935af62b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2f25f960_8135e311",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_pkvm_module.h",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 301,
      "author": {
        "id": 1965911
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-10T09:42:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d be worried about the indeterminism of this, as they may be implemented by 2 different modules. Anyway, no strong opinion, we can keep like this and see how it goes.",
      "parentUuid": "32239f07_bf25c3d1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 301,
        "startChar": 51,
        "endLine": 301,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "5e06f64ca5970b20148bdbb105b5ec36935af62b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5e66e8f8_d68adf5a",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_pkvm_module.h",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 301,
      "author": {
        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-10T09:46:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s just it feels weird to have one of \"higher\" importance than the other, even though I know the assignment can\u0027t work without the reset being called. But there\u0027s nothing in the name that suggest it should be called before the other one.\n\nAlternatively, we could have a separate callback for setting the cookie?",
      "parentUuid": "2f25f960_8135e311",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 301,
        "startChar": 51,
        "endLine": 301,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "5e06f64ca5970b20148bdbb105b5ec36935af62b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f922bcac_4135df26",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_pkvm_module.h",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 301,
      "author": {
        "id": 1965911
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-10T09:47:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That feel more strange, the cookie should be tied to a callback I guess, maybe register all callbacks with one call, have something as `pkvm_power_ops` struct that the module can register along with the cookie?",
      "parentUuid": "5e66e8f8_d68adf5a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 301,
        "startChar": 51,
        "endLine": 301,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "5e06f64ca5970b20148bdbb105b5ec36935af62b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
